   562 				; Step $09 - Menu banner palette-demo overlay: assembly-embed the RGB ramps
   563 				; for hardware palettes 1-3 directly into MENU_BANNER_PAL_VRAM (bank $34),
   564 				; at the same $0300/$0600/$0900 slot offsets Apply_Menu_Banner_Palette
   565 				; (view1024.asm) already reads for registers 1/2/3.  Replaces the old
   566 				; D:MENU.PAL disk load - same "select bank, then org+ins" idiom as
   567 				; Load_Palette1/Load_Palette2 above, so the bytes land straight into VBXE
   568 				; RAM as the OS loader streams this .xex in, no runtime copy needed.
