   546 				; Load_Image_Palette - read just the .PAL block (the first one) of File_Index's
   547 				; .V1K and set all 4 hardware palette registers.  File_Index must be set before
   548 				; calling.  Used by Selector_Handle_P (P-preview, ui.asm), which must not touch
   549 				; the framebuffer or CRAM.
