  1237 37F0			Handle_Keys
  1238 				; Dispatch on the current UI mode - the selector, slideshow, drive picker and
  1239 				; info viewer each have their own key set (ui.asm); mode 1 (image view) uses
  1240 				; the set below.
  1241 37F0 AD FC 02			lda CH
