   123 				; Toggle_Font - flip the text screen between the CGA ($44) and Atari ($45)
   124 				; font by rewriting the two XDLC_CHBASE bytes (main + footer text blocks) in
   125 				; XDL_MainMenu.  The VBXE re-reads the XDL each frame, so the change shows on
