   109
   110 				; sort the two real groups independently: dirs [FileStart-Dir_Count .. FileStart)
   111 				; then files [FileStart .. ImageCount).  ".." (if present) stays pinned at 0.
   112 4D98 AD DA 04			lda FileStart
