   829 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   830 				; Selector_DrawStatus - repaint row 20 for the current Sel_Index.  Blank for a
   831 				; directory / ".." row or an empty list; "Src: <name>" for a *.V1K row whose
   832 				; slot was filled from IMAGES.LST.  Pure VRAM read - no file I/O.
   833 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
