   944 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   945 				; Nfo_Name_LoadManifest - open "D[n]:PATH IMAGES.LST", and for every record
   946 				; (8-byte key + source name + $9B) store the name into the matching *.V1K
   947 				; row's slot.  Called from Rescan_Images right after Nfo_Name_ClearCache.
   948 				; A missing / unreadable file just leaves every slot $00 (blank status line).
   949 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
